cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "CIELab–sRGB Gamut Plotter"
abstract: >-
  A desktop tool to plot experimental CIELab colour-measurement data on top of
  the true sRGB colour gamut at a chosen lightness L*. Each unique composition
  automatically receives its own colour and marker, and publication-ready
  figures can be exported.
